      "message": "feat(search): default to Hot sort and surface sort pills above results (#365)\n\n* feat(search): default to Hot sort and surface sort pills above results\n\nThe existing sort selector was a small dropdown next to the search bar\nthat users were missing. Promote it to a prominent pill row matching\nthe Trending/Discovery feed pattern so picking a sort mode feels like a\nprimary action, not a hidden option.\n\nDefault sort changes from `relevance` to `hot` (recent + high engagement)\nso a fresh /search?q=X lands on lively videos by default. URL\ncanonicalization follows: `?sort=hot` is omitted; any other mode is\nwritten. Anyone who shared a `?sort=top` link still gets Top.\n\nTests cover: default `hot` initialization, URL param honored on load,\nand round-trip URL write/erase when user changes mode.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(search): harden sort pills\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.7 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>",
